  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A8 02}这里是第４层……了啊。\n按之前的规律，\n那个“守卫”应该也快到了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 08 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 75 11}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8A 02}怎么了，巽老师？\n该不会害怕了吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}别、别那么叫我！\n我又没决定要当老师，\n而且也有些在意的事……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9B 02}啊，学习成绩吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9C 05}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}噗！？\n直接戳中我的弱点……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 FE 05}……不过说真的，\n让我教别人功课，\n总觉得没什么实感……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 0C}……要不实际教教看？\n这样或许就能知道\n自己适不适合了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AA 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}在、在这里！？\n连课本都没有，肯定不行吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}顶多也只能教点小学程度的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 0C}我就是小学生哦。\n完全可以陪你试试。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 FE 05}……可、可是。\n现在也没时间做这种事……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e813_200.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 11}哦——还真是畏畏缩缩啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
